  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Statement I:&nbsp;A cyclist is moving on an unbanked road with a speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and takes a sharp circular turn along a path of the radius of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> without reducing the speed. The static friction coefficient is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></math>. The cyclist will not slip and pass the curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Statement II : If the road is banked at an angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>, cyclist can cross the curve of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> radius with the speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> without slipping. In the light of the above statements, choose the correct answer from the options given below.</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Statement I is incorrect and statement II is correct",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Statement I is correct and statement II is<br />incorrect",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Both statement I and statement II are false",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Both statement I and statement II are true",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Statement I<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mi>&#956;</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>g</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>97</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>944</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Speed is lower than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></math>, hence it can take safe<br />turn.</p><p>Statement II&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">Rg</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>tan&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;tan&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>42</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Speed is lower than <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></math>, hence it can take safe turn.</p>"
